{
  "_doc": [
    "Routine (recurring) tasks. Each row maps directly to one TaskEntity.",
    "`assignees` is a list of displayName strings (must match users.json).",
    "`kind` is `recurring` (the seeder only handles this kind).",
    "`dueTime` is `HH:MM` local. `recurrence` matches the engine pattern shape:",
    "  { \"preset\": \"daily\" } | { \"preset\": \"weekdays\" } | { \"preset\": \"weekends\" }",
    "  | { \"preset\": \"weekly\", \"days\": [0..6] }   (0 = Sunday)",
    "  | { \"preset\": \"biweekly\", \"days\": [...], \"anchor\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\" }",
    "`ladder` is the escalation ladder. The Restriction component of any tier",
    "is silently skipped for non-Restrictable Trackees (adults), so the same",
    "ladder is safe to assign to mixed groups."
  ],
